ebook CRs, pipeline resources).\n50\t- Gallery visibility/enablement follows the Dashboard's existing per-component\n51\t  feature flag mechanism.\n52\t- Incidental UI text and screenshot updates that fall out of this change are\n53\t  included here; no new documentation topics are authored in this epic.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- Given a user with a project, when they open the tutorial gallery and click a\n58\t  notebook tutorial, then a workbench opens in their project running the\n59\t  tutorial notebook on the pinned image.\n60\t- Given a user with a project, when they click a pipeline tutorial, then the\n61\t  tutorial pipeline is imported into their project.\n62\t- The gallery renders the curated tutorial set from packages conforming to the\n63\t  tutorial packaging format, with no tutorial content hardcoded in the\n64\t  Dashboard.\n65\t- The gallery is verified against at least one packaged notebook tutorial and\n66\t  one packaged pipeline tutorial.\n67\t- The feature can be enabled/disabled through the Dashboard's existing\n68\t  configuration mechanism.\n69\t\n70\t## HLR Traceability\n71\t\n72\t- HLR-1 (P0) — \"The Dashboard has a tutorial gallery from which a user can\n73\t  launch a tutorial into their project (opening a workbench with the notebook,\n74\t  or importing the pipeline).\" This epic fully covers HLR-1.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-90d9eb7b94eca350","agent_id":"aa0bc7ece39567856","session_id":"6bb350ac-77bc-4e4b-90d8-d4ea0771fd78","uuid":"e063c28c-b0ee-46c5-bbe4-9ff6e0bb359d","timestamp":"2026-10-26T20:42:44.084Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-88ebd4458c1fabf2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
