{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a47f167fd419b77f","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9019-E003\n3\ttitle: Five notebook-based getting-started tutorials (workbench, data prep, training,\n4\t  deployment, RAG)\n5\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9019\n6\tcomponent: Notebooks\n7\tteam: Workbenches\n8\ttype: Implementation\n9\tpriority: P0\n10\tdependencies:\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9019-E001\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 1\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 0\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 1\n19\t  human_process_gates: 0\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 6\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# Five notebook-based getting-started tutorials (workbench, data prep, training, deployment, RAG)\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tThis epic authors the five notebook-based tutorials of the curated\n36\tgetting-started set, covering the core journeys that run in a workbench: first\n37\tworkbench, data prep, first training run, first deployment, and first RAG app.\n38\tEach tutorial is authored as content, packaged per the tutorial packaging\n39\tformat, and tested against the current release. This is substantive content\n40\tauthoring — a distinct work stream from the gallery product code.\n41\t\n42\t## Scope\n43\t\n44\t- Author five curated notebook tutorials:\n45\t  1. First workbench — creating and using a first workbench.\n46\t  2. Data prep — preparing data in a workbench.\n47\t  3. First training run — training a first model.\n48\t  4. First deployment — deploying a first model from a workbench.\n49\t  5. First RAG app — building a first retrieval-augmented-generation app.\n50\t- Package each tutorial per the tutorial packaging format (metadata, pinned\n51\t  workbench images, validation manifest) so it is versioned and testable\n52\t  independently of Dashboard releases.\n53\t- Test each tutorial against the current release using its validation\n54\t  manifest, and fix content that fails.\n55\t- Curate the content for a new-user audience (time-to-first-success is the\n56\t  strategy's driver); keep tutorials maintained as part of the curated set.\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- Five notebook tutorials exist covering first workbench, data prep, first\n61\t  training run, first deployment, and first RAG app.\n62\t- Each tutorial is packaged per the tutorial packaging format with metadata,\n63\t  a pinned workbench image, and a validation manifest.\n64\t- Each tutorial's validation run passes against the current release (pass/fail\n65\t  per tutorial, evidenced by the validation manifest results).\n66\t- Each tutorial is launchable from the Dashboard tutorial gallery into a user\n67\t  project (verified as part of the tutorial's validation).\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- HLR-2 (P0, partial) — \"Six curated tutorials exist covering the core\n72\t  journeys … Each is tested against the current release.\" This epic covers the\n73\t  five notebook-based journeys; the first-pipeline tutorial is a separate epic\n74\t  under the Data Science Pipelines component and team.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b4498af45c591be3","agent_id":"a45da96e282cf5d9d","session_id":"6bb350ac-77bc-4e4b-90d8-d4ea0771fd78","uuid":"cdd7625a-33bc-4924-88c6-8e8d0a2b8a97","timestamp":"2026-10-26T20:44:52.255Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a47f167fd419b77f","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9019"}
